category add kitchen Кухня root
product add mug kitchen Кружка "Керамическая кружка"
product attribute mug capacity integer yes 250 500
variant add mug MUG-250 "250 мл" 300 100 100 100 capacity=250
variant add mug MUG-500 "500 мл" 400 100 100 150 capacity=500
product publish mug
price set MUG-250 700
price set MUG-500 900
receipt post mugs Поставщик MUG-250 10 300 batch-250 MUG-500 10 400 batch-500
catalog search Кружка root capacity=250
stock show
as customer alice
wish add mug
wish to-cart mug MUG-250
order preview pickup home
quit
